# Proj18's build (Vite) injects its <script>/<link> tags with LF regardless of the
# source template's line endings. Without this, a CRLF-checked-out index.html plus
# LF-injected tags produces a mixed-line-ending file that differs on every rebuild,
# which fails the "committed page matches the build" CI check non-deterministically
# depending on the checkout's line endings. Force LF so the build is reproducible.
/Proj18_Coffee_Storefront/index.html text eol=lf
/docs/coffee-store/** text eol=lf
